<h1>AGENTS.md — Python / uv block (drop-in)</h1>
<h2>Stack</h2>
<ul><li>Python managed by <code>uv</code> (uv.lock committed).</li><li>Python version pinned in <code>pyproject.toml</code> <code>requires-python</code>.</li></ul>
<h2>Rules for agents</h2>
<ol><li>Run all project commands through <code>uv run &lt;cmd&gt;</code>. Bare <code>python</code> / <code>pytest</code> / <code>mypy</code> is forbidden.</li><li>Add deps via <code>uv add &lt;pkg&gt;</code> (runtime) or <code>uv add --dev &lt;pkg&gt;</code> (dev). Never edit <code>uv.lock</code> by hand.</li><li>Bump versions via <code>uv lock --upgrade-package &lt;name&gt;</code>; never delete and recreate <code>uv.lock</code>.</li><li>Install global tools (ruff, ty, mutmut, pre-commit) via <code>uv tool install &lt;name&gt;</code>, not into the project env.</li><li>CI installs with <code>uv sync --frozen --all-extras</code>. If that fails, fix <code>pyproject.toml</code> and re-lock locally before re-pushing.</li></ol>
